# Mee Myself and I — C-Mee-PO

When drafting or editing `mee-myself-and-i` Guide posts, follow the full charter in `utilities/penang-pulse/EDITORIAL.md` → **Mee Myself and I — C-Mee-PO voice**, **Guides publish cycle**, and **Agent handoff / session practices**.

## Hard rules

- Human narrator = venue, timing, taste, judgment. **C-Mee-PO** = dish/ingredient lore (reused research OK).
- Attribute with `**C-Mee-PO:**` in normal body paragraphs after a short prose setup. Never `>` for him (that’s a practical tip).
- **Dialogue handoff required** before tasting: attributed question (`**C-Mee-PO:** How are you finding it?`), then plain first person — no `Me:`.
- Optional once-per-article `###` for a long brief only.
- Catchphrases: ~1 per article (bank or one-off dry-wit closer OK). Singularity dinner line only for heavy/fatty/spicy, max every 4th–5th episode. Tokens top-up = rare comic.
- Strip multi-dish chat dumps when pasting research. Keep meal time consistent across dek + body.
- Photos: kebab-case filenames; seller then dish; `_caption_` after image (blank line OK). Natural aspect — no forced 3:2.
- Front matter: `location.name` + `location.mapsUrl` for spot widget; `seriesOrder` by tasting date.
- CMS Build ≠ live. Publish: `npx firebase-tools deploy --only hosting:penang-pulse` → verify `https://penangpulse.com` only. Prefer skip agent `git push` if approval stalls; note `PUSH_SKIPPED`. Never `git config` — author via env when committing.
- After publishing a Mee episode: sync `utilities/penang-pulse/MEE-CHECKLIST.md` from published posts — tick **Tried** (and **Optional revisits** for style revisits); clear the matching planning-list line.
- After publishing a Mee episode: update the Mee-Search graph (`mee-graph/tools/src_*.py` → `python3 build_graph.py`) so Bowl Orbit “Tasted so far” picks up the dish. Full step in `EDITORIAL.md` → Guides publish cycle item 15.

## Pattern

```markdown
I asked C-Mee-PO what I was actually eating.

**C-Mee-PO:** [research summary]

**C-Mee-PO:** How are you finding it?

[First-person tasting — no Me: label]

I’d eat that if I had a mouth!
```
